  "counting_unit": "Component SQL explicitly counts DISTINCT read_id grouped by tool and canonical cell. Per-cell sums therefore count unique read-cell pairs; a physical read assigned to two cells contributes to both. Repeated UMI/segment calls within one read-cell pair do not increase read counts. Component SQL excludes empty barcode or empty UMI, maps RT primer sequences to the same-well T-primer sequence, and restricts canonical cells to the published568 set. The retained RAD ED2 normalized ledger was independently replayed after the same RT-well normalization: all568 per-cell read and UMI counts match exactly. Original RAD tally producer is unlocated; the added portable validator supplies the checkpoint-to-table step.",
